<view class="container permission-page">
  <view class="permission-hero">
    <view class="permission-eyebrow">热念 · 权限管理</view>
    <view class="permission-title">给彼此一点可爱的“特许”</view>
    <view class="permission-sub">
      你可以自定义授予 TA 的权限；TA 给你的权限只能查看，不能替 TA 修改。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card permission-editor">
    <view class="card-title">{{editingId ? '编辑我给 TA 的权限' : '新增一项权限'}}</view>

    <view class="preset-row" wx:if="{{!editingId}}">
      <view
        class="preset-chip"
        wx:for="{{presets}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-name="{{item}}"
        bindtap="choosePreset"
      >
        {{item}}
      </view>
    </view>

    <input
      class="permission-input"
      value="{{name}}"
      placeholder="例如：亲嘴权、抱抱权、选片权"
      maxlength="20"
      bindinput="onNameInput"
    />

    <textarea
      class="permission-note"
      value="{{note}}"
      placeholder="补一句规则或备注（选填）"
      maxlength="100"
      auto-height
      bindinput="onNoteInput"
    />

    <view class="editor-actions">
      <button
        wx:if="{{editingId}}"
        class="cancel-btn"
        bindtap="cancelEdit"
      >
        取消
      </button>
      <button
        class="save-btn"
        bindtap="submitPermission"
        disabled="{{saving || !name}}"
      >
        {{editingId ? '保存修改' : '授予 TA'}}
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">我给 TA 的</view>
      <view class="section-sub">你可以暂停、恢复、编辑或删除</view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-count">{{myPermissions.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{myPermissions.length}}">
    <view
      class="permission-card {{item.enabled ? '' : 'permission-card-off'}}"
      wx:for="{{myPermissions}}"
      wx:key="id"
    >
      <view class="permission-main">
        <view class="permission-name-row">
          <view class="permission-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="status-pill {{item.enabled ? 'status-on' : 'status-off'}}">
            {{item.enabled ? '生效中' : '已暂停'}}
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="permission-note-text" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
        <view class="permission-note-empty" wx:else>没有额外备注</view>
      </view>

      <view class="permission-controls">
        <view class="switch-label">{{item.enabled ? '允许' : '暂停'}}</view>
        <switch
          checked="{{item.enabled}}"
          color="#ff6b81"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindchange="onToggle"
        />
        <view class="text-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="startEdit">编辑</view>
        <view class="text-action danger-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deletePermission">删除</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty permission-empty" wx:else>
    还没有给 TA 权限。可以先从「抱抱权」开始 💗
  </view>

  <view class="section-head received-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">TA 给我的</view>
      <view class="section-sub">由 TA 决定是否生效</view>
    </view>
    <view class="section-count">{{receivedPermissions.length}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{receivedPermissions.length}}">
    <view
      class="permission-card received-card {{item.enabled ? '' : 'permission-card-off'}}"
      wx:for="{{receivedPermissions}}"
      wx:key="id"
    >
      <view class="permission-main">
        <view class="permission-name-row">
          <view class="permission-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="status-pill {{item.enabled ? 'status-on' : 'status-off'}}">
            {{item.enabled ? '我拥有' : '已暂停'}}
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="permission-note-text" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
        <view class="permission-note-empty" wx:else>TA 没有写额外备注</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty permission-empty" wx:else>
    TA 还没有给你权限。
  </view>

  <view class="permission-footnote">
    权限只是你们之间的小约定，不代表现实中的强制同意；任何时候都应尊重对方当下的意愿。
  </view>
</view>
